; Last Hero in English. Uzbek is what every data file says; this table is the English overlay (see
; docs/plan/2026-10-15-english.md and content/Lang.java). One row a line:
;
;   "the Uzbek exactly as a data file has it" => "the English"
;
; Rows are kept in the order of the files they come from. A string a file has and this table lacks is said in
; Uzbek; a row whose English is its Uzbek means "looked at, the same in both" (a name, a licence line).
; "@Field text" is a row for that field alone. English uses plain ASCII and the dashes: the menu font has no more.

; ---- fixture-creatures.duke ----
"Hero" => "Hero"
"Skeleton" => "Skeleton"

; ---- story/act1.duke ----
"1-qism: Oxirgi qahramon" => "Part 1: The Last Hero"
"Jang maydonidan qora qasrgacha. Hikoya shu yerdan boshlanadi." => "From the battlefield to the dark castle. The story begins here."
"Qo'mondon" => "Commander"
"Malika" => "Queen"
"Dushman sarkardasi" => "Enemy Commander"
"Qora ritsar" => "Dark Knight"
"Temirchi Usta" => "Master Smith"
"Zebo momo" => "Granny Zebo"
"Temirchi" => "Blacksmith"
"Momo" => "Granny"
"Safni ushlang! Darvozadan bir qadam ham chekinmaymiz!" => "Hold the line! We will not give up a single step from the gate!"
"Taslim bo'l, qo'mondon. Qahramonlaringiz allaqachon tugagan." => "Surrender, commander. Your heroes are already finished."
"Qahramon bo'lmasa ham — biz bormiz!" => "We may have no hero, but we are still here!"
"Bu... qayer? Hozirgina Erika bilan mashq qilayotgan edim..." => "Where... is this? I was just training with Erika..."
"Osmondan nur tushdi — demak, sen qahramonsan! Savollarni keyin ber, hozir qilichingni ol!" => "Light fell from the sky — so you are the hero! Questions later, draw your sword now!"
"Yo'q... qayerdan kelding sen?.." => "No... where did you come from?.."
"Bu jang meniki edi." => "This fight was mine."
"Ular qochmoqda! Bugun biz yutdik — sen tufayli." => "They are running! We won today — thanks to you."
"Bu dunyoda qahramon qolmagan. Sen chaqirilgan oxirgi qahramonsan." => "There are no heroes left in this world. You are the last hero to be summoned."
"Men uyga qaytishim kerak. U meni kutyapti." => "I have to get home. She is waiting for me."
"Unda malikaning huzuriga yur. Yo'lni faqat u biladi." => "Then go to the queen. Only she knows the way."
"Darvoza oldidagi jang" => "The Battle at the Gate"
"Dushman sarkardasini yiqiting" => "Defeat the enemy commander"
"Bu — poytaxt. Malika saroyda kutmoqda. Ortimdan yur." => "This is the capital. The queen is waiting in the palace. Follow me."
"Xush kelibsiz, qahramon. Qo'mondon darvoza oldidagi jangni aytib berdi." => "Welcome, hero. The commander has told me of the battle at the gate."
"Saltanatimni qora ritsar bosib oldi: qal'alarimiz uning qo'lida, xalqim qo'rquvda." => "The Dark Knight has taken my kingdom: our castles are in his hands, and my people live in fear."
"Mana, oltin — va bu medalyon. U siz o'ldirgan har bir dushmanning jonini yutib, kuchini sizga quyadi." => "Here is gold — and this medallion. It drinks the life of every enemy you slay and pours their strength into you."
"Uni faqat qahramon taqa oladi." => "Only a hero can wear it."
"Qora ritsarni o'ldirsam, uyga qayta olamanmi?" => "If I kill the Dark Knight, can I go home?"
"Ha. Uni o'ldiring — yo'l ochiladi. Ammo avval mashq qiling: hozir u sizni bir zarbada yiqitadi." => "Yes. Kill him and the way will open. But train first: right now he would cut you down in a single blow."
"Mashq maydoni — shahar ostidagi eski qabrlar. Ikki qavat tushing, so'ng qayting." => "The training ground is the old crypts beneath the city. Go down two floors, then come back."
"Mashq" => "Training"
"Shahar darvozasidan mashq maydoniga chiqing" => "Leave through the city gate for the training ground"
"Qaytdingizmi, qahramon? Medalyon to'yinmoqda — sezyapsizmi?" => "You are back, hero? The medallion is feeding — can you feel it?"
"Endi urush. Bosib olingan qal'alarni birma-bir ozod qilamiz: kalitni topamiz, darvozani ochamiz, sarkardasini o'ldiramiz." => "Now, war. We will free the captured castles one by one: find the key, open the gate, kill the commander."
"Boring. Har bir o'lim sizni kuchliroq qiladi." => "Go. Every death makes you stronger."
"Urushga" => "To War"
"Shahar darvozasidan urushga chiqing" => "Leave through the city gate for the war"
"Qahramon! Yerto'lamdan skeletlar chiqib kelyapti. Yerto'la shaharning o'ng yuqori burchagida, mening ustaxonam tepasida. Uchala skeletni qirib bering — evaziga qo'lqop beraman." => "Hero! Skeletons are crawling out of my cellar. The cellar is in the upper right corner of the city, above my workshop. Cut down all three skeletons — in return I will give you gauntlets."
"Tinchlik qaytdi! Mana, va'da qilgan qo'lqopim." => "Peace has returned! Here are the gauntlets I promised."
"O'g'lim, marhum cholimning uzugini yerto'lada tushirib qo'ydim. Topib bersang, duo qilaman." => "Son, I dropped my late husband's ring in the cellar. If you find it for me, I will bless you."
"Topdingmi! Ilohim, yo'ling ochiq bo'lsin. Mana bu tumorni ol — senga asqatadi." => "You found it! May your road always be open. Take this charm — it will serve you well."
"Yerto'ladagi skeletlar" => "Skeletons in the Cellar"
"Temirchining yerto'lasi shaharning o'ng yuqori (shimoli-sharqiy) burchagida, ustaxonasining tepasida — M xaritada belgilangan. U yerga boring, uchala skeletni o'ldiring, so'ng temirchiga qayting." => "The blacksmith's cellar is in the upper right (north-east) corner of the city, above his workshop — marked on the M map. Go there, kill all three skeletons, then return to the blacksmith."
"Temirchiga qayting" => "Return to the blacksmith"
"Momoning uzugi" => "Granny's Ring"
"Zebo momo cholining uzugini yerto'lada tushirib qo'ygan. Yerto'la shaharning o'ng yuqori burchagida — M xaritada belgilangan." => "Granny Zebo dropped her late husband's ring in the cellar. The cellar is in the upper right corner of the city — marked on the M map."
"Shaharning o'ng yuqori burchagidagi yerto'lada uzukni toping" => "Find the ring in the cellar in the upper right corner of the city"
"Uzukni Zebo momoga bering" => "Give the ring to Granny Zebo"
"Cholning uzugi" => "Old Man's Ring"
"Yetarli. Medalyon kuchimni sezyapman. Endi poytaxtga qaytaman." => "Enough. I can feel the medallion's power. Now I return to the capital."
"Mashq: eski qabrlar" => "Training: The Old Crypts"
"Ikkinchi qavat qo'riqchisini yenging" => "Defeat the guardian of the second floor"
"Mana, birinchi bosib olingan qal'a. Tashqaridagilarni qiring, kalitni oling, darvozani oching — sarkardasi ichkarida." => "Here is the first captured castle. Cut down those outside, take the key, open the gate — the commander is inside."
"Bir qal'a ozod! Keyingisi — qora ritsar qasriga yo'l ochadigan oxirgi qal'a." => "One castle is free! The next is the last, the one that opens the way to the Dark Knight's castle."
"Yerlarimiz ozod. Qolgani — qora qasr. U yerga sen yolg'iz borasan, qahramon." => "Our lands are free. Only the dark castle remains. You go there alone, hero."
"Bosib olingan yerlar" => "The Conquered Lands"
"Birinchi qal'a sarkardasini o'ldiring" => "Kill the commander of the first castle"
"Ikkinchi qal'a sarkardasini o'ldiring" => "Kill the commander of the second castle"
"Yana bittasi... Malika seni ham yubordimi?" => "Another one... Did the queen send you too?"
"Seni o'ldirsam, uyga qaytaman." => "If I kill you, I go home."
"Men ham bir vaqtlar shunday deganman." => "I once said the same."
"Ha-ha-ha... Rahmat, qahramon." => "Ha-ha-ha... Thank you, hero."
"Medalyon to'ldi — va u yana mening qo'limda." => "The medallion is full — and it is in my hands again."
"Sen... meni aldading. Qora ritsar ham men kabi chaqirilgan edi..." => "You... tricked me. The Dark Knight was summoned just like me..."
"Endi bu qasrning xo'jayini sensan. Abadiy. Menga yangi qahramon kerak bo'lganda — yana jang qilasan." => "Now you are the lord of this castle. Forever. And when I need a new hero — you will fight again."
"Qora qasr" => "The Dark Castle"
"Qora ritsarni o'ldiring" => "Kill the Dark Knight"
"1-qism" => "Part 1"
"Poytaxt" => "Capital"
"1-qism tugadi" => "Part 1 complete"
"Davomi bor..." => "To be continued..."
"Shaharning o'ng yuqori burchagidagi yerto'laga boring, skeletlarni qiring %d/%d" => "Go to the cellar in the upper right corner of the city and slay the skeletons %d/%d"
"Soqchi" => "Guard"
"Qahramon bo'lmasa ham — biz bormiz! Kohinlar, chaqiring uni!" => "We may have no hero, but we are still here! Ritualists, summon him!"
"Osmondan olov bo'lib tushding — demak, sen qahramonsan. Kohinlar seni chaqirdi." => "You fell from the sky in flame — so you are the hero. The ritualists summoned you."
"Yo'q... yana bittasi?! Chekinish!" => "No... another one?! Retreat!"
"Ular qochmoqda! Askarlar, qolganini tugating!" => "They are running! Soldiers, finish off the rest!"
"Unda malikaning huzuriga yur. Yo'lni faqat u biladi. Ortimdan yur — saroy shahar ichida." => "Then go to the queen. Only she knows the way. Follow me — the palace is inside the city."
"Qo'mondon izidan" => "Following the Commander"
"Qo'mondon sizni malika saroyiga olib boradi. Uning ortidan yuring: boshi uzra oltin belgi bor. Uzoqlashsangiz, u sizni kutadi." => "The commander is taking you to the queen's palace. Follow her: there is a golden mark above her head. If you fall behind, she will wait for you."
"Qo'mondon izidan saroyga boring" => "Follow the commander to the palace"
"Hozir u yerga bormaymiz. Avval malikaning huzuriga." => "We are not going there now. First, to the queen."
"Hozir u yerga bormaymiz." => "We are not going there now."
"Bu — poytaxt. Malika saroyda, taxtida kutmoqda. Yur." => "This is the capital. The queen is waiting in the palace, on her throne. Come."
"Mashq — shimoliy darvoza ortidagi eski qabrlarda. U yerda o'liklar tinmaydi: ularning qo'riqchisini yeng, so'ng qayt." => "Training is in the old crypts beyond the north gate. The dead do not rest there: defeat their guardian, then come back."
"Shimoliy darvozadan chiqib, eski qabrlarga boring" => "Leave through the north gate and go to the old crypts"
"Saroyga qaytish" => "Return to the Palace"
"Malika saroyiga qayting" => "Return to the queen's palace"
"Shimoliy darvozadan urushga chiqing" => "Leave through the north gate for the war"
"Yetarli. Medalyon kuchimni sezyapman. Endi saroyga qaytaman." => "Enough. I can feel the medallion's power. Now I return to the palace."
"Qabrlar qo'riqchisini yenging" => "Defeat the guardian of the crypts"

; ---- story/act2.duke ----
"2-qism: Kamonchi" => "Part 2: The Archer"
"Yillar o'tib, u yigitini izlab keladi. 1-qism saqlangan bo'lsa, o'sha yerdan davom etadi." => "Years later, she comes looking for her beloved. If Part 1 was saved, it continues from there."
"Novvoy Karim" => "Baker Karim"
"Qorovul Jasur" => "Guard Jasur"
"Oqsoqol Hamid" => "Elder Hamid"
"Novvoy" => "Baker"
"Qorovul" => "Guard"
"Oqsoqol" => "Elder"
"Yana o'sha nur... Yillar davomida uni izladim — va shu nur meni ham olib keldi." => "That same light again... For years I searched for it — and this light has brought me here too."
"U shu dunyoda. Bilaman." => "He is in this world. I know it."
"Yana nur... Saltanat yana qahramon chaqirdi. Sen kimsan?" => "Another light... The kingdom has summoned a hero again. Who are you?"
"Men bir yigitni izlayapman. U bundan yillar oldin shu yerga tushgan — qilichli, bir oz sarosimada." => "I am looking for a young man. Years ago he fell here — with a sword, a little bewildered."
"Oxirgi qahramon... U qora qasrga ketdi va qaytmadi. Malika u haqda gapirishni taqiqlagan." => "The last hero... He went to the dark castle and never came back. The queen has forbidden anyone to speak of him."
"Men senga ko'p narsa aytolmayman. Shaharda so'ra — odamlar men aytolmaganni biladi." => "I cannot tell you much. Ask in the city — people know what I cannot say."
"Qahramon? Ha, bir vaqtlar bor edi. Endi uning nomini aytish ham qo'rqinchli. Qora qasrdan yovuzlik keladi, deyishadi." => "A hero? Yes, there was one once. Now even saying his name is frightening. They say evil comes from the dark castle."
"Yigirma yil qorovullik qildim — malika bir kun ham qarimadi. Ajib, a? Lekin buni men aytmadim." => "Twenty years I have stood guard — and the queen has not aged a day. Strange, eh? But I did not say that."
"Bobom yosh bo'lganida ham malika shunday go'zal edi. Uning yoshini hech kim bilmaydi..." => "Even when my grandfather was young, the queen was just as beautiful. No one knows her age..."
"Qahramonni izlayapsanmi? Unda malikaning sirini bil — u bilan birga." => "Looking for the hero? Then learn the queen's secret — it comes with him."
"Qorong'i o'rmonning tubida, tovuq oyoqli kulbada Yalmog'iz kampir yashaydi. Malikaning sirini faqat u biladi." => "Deep in the dark forest, in a hut on chicken legs, lives the crone Baba Yaga. Only she knows the queen's secret."
"Unda o'rmonga boraman." => "Then I will go to the forest."
"Uni izlab" => "In Search of Him"
"Shaharda so'rab-surishtiring: oqsoqol nimadir biladi" => "Ask around the city: the elder knows something"
"Qorong'i o'rmondagi kampir" => "The Crone of the Dark Forest"
"Qorong'i o'rmon tubidagi Yalmog'iz kampirni toping" => "Find the crone Baba Yaga deep in the dark forest"
"Kampirning bahosi" => "The Crone's Price"
"O'rmondagi o'likchini o'ldiring" => "Kill the necromancer in the forest"
"Kampirga qayting" => "Return to the crone"
"Qafas kaliti" => "Cage Key"
"Ozodman! Rahmat, opa. Kampir sizga sirni aytsa — ishoning, u yolg'on gapirmaydi. Faqat narxini so'raydi." => "I am free! Thank you, sister. If the crone tells you the secret — believe her, she does not lie. She only asks her price."
"Qafasdagi qiz" => "The Maiden in the Cage"
"Qafas kalitini o'likchidan oling" => "Take the cage key from the necromancer"
"Qizni qafasdan chiqaring" => "Free the girl from the cage"
"Yashil dala ozod. Savdogarlar yo'lga qaytadi." => "The Green Field is free. The merchants return to the road."
"Toshli adir ozod. Tog' yo'llari yana ochiq." => "The Stony Hills are free. The mountain roads are open again."
"Qumli dasht ozod. Karvonlar yana o'tadi." => "The Sandy Steppe is free. The caravans will pass again."
"Uchala yer ozod. Malika qasrining sehri zaiflashdi — endi darvoza ochiladi." => "All three lands are free. The magic of the queen's castle has weakened — now the gate will open."
"Darvoza sehr bilan yopiq. Kampir aytgandek — avval yerlarni ozod qilishim kerak." => "The gate is sealed by magic. Just as the crone said — I must free the lands first."
"Yashil dala" => "Green Field"
"Yashil dala lagerini tozalang" => "Clear the Green Field camp"
"Toshli adir" => "Stony Hills"
"Toshli adir lagerini tozalang" => "Clear the Stony Hills camp"
"Qumli dasht" => "Sandy Steppe"
"Qumli dasht lagerini tozalang" => "Clear the Sandy Steppe camp"
"Malika qasri" => "The Queen's Castle"
"Malika qasriga boring" => "Go to the Queen's Castle"
"Yillar o'tib" => "Years later"
"Malika zali" => "The Queen's Hall"
"2-qism" => "Part 2"
"Oxiri" => "The End"
"La'nat ko'tarildi" => "The curse is lifted"
"Siz bo'lmaganingizda, hali ham o'sha qafasda bo'lardim. Qo'mondon menga boshpana berdi." => "If not for you, I would still be in that cage. The commander gave me shelter."
"Ozod" => "Freed"

