; ---- story/final.duke ----
"La'natlangan qahramon" => "Cursed Hero"
"Demak, sen ham keldingmi, qizaloq. Uning qalbi endi meniki." => "So you came too, girl. His heart is mine now."
"U mening yigitim. Uni uyga olib ketaman." => "He is my beloved. I am taking him home."
"Olib ket — agar uni yenga olsang." => "Take him — if you can beat him."
"Ritsarim! Yonimga kel — uni to'xtat!" => "My knight! Come to me — stop her!"
"Seni o'ldirmayman. Bu sen emassan — bu medalyon." => "I will not kill you. This is not you — it is the medallion."
"Yaroqsiz qul! Unda o'zim tugataman." => "Useless slave! Then I will finish her myself."
"Yo'q... yoshligim... jonlar..." => "No... my youth... the souls..."
"Medalyon sindi. Ular endi ozod." => "The medallion is broken. They are free now."
"Men... qayerdaman? Sen... sen meni izlab kelding." => "Where... am I? You... you came looking for me."
"Uyga ketamiz." => "Let's go home."

; ---- story/kampir.duke ----
"Yalmog'iz kampir" => "Baba Yaga"
"Qiz" => "Maiden"
"Oho, mehmon... Qorong'i o'rmonga o'z oyog'i bilan kelgan qahramonni ko'pdan beri ko'rmagandim." => "Oho, a guest... It has been a long while since a hero walked into the dark forest on his own two feet."
"Malikangning bo'ynidagi medalyon... Uni kim yasaganini bilasanmi? Men bilaman, bolam." => "The medallion around your queen's neck... Do you know who made it? I do, child."
"Har bir sirning bahosi bor. Hali vaqti emas — qaytib kel, shunda gaplashamiz." => "Every secret has its price. It is not yet time — come back, and then we will talk."
"Sirni bilmoqchimisan, qizim? Bepul emas. Avval mening ishimni bajar." => "You want to know the secret, my girl? It is not free. First do a job for me."
"O'rmonimda bir o'likchi kezadi — qabrlarimni o'g'irlab, jonlarni o'ziga bo'ysundiradi." => "A necromancer roams my forest — robbing my graves and bending souls to his will."
"Uni yo'q qil. Qaytib kelganingda, malikangning sirini aytaman." => "Destroy him. When you come back, I will tell you your queen's secret."
"Bajarding... Unda eshit. Medalyonni men yasaganman — malikaning buyurtmasi bilan." => "You did it... Then listen. I made the medallion — on the queen's order."
"U har bir o'ldirilgan dushmanning jonini yutadi. O'sha jonlar malikani abadiy yosh va go'zal saqlaydi." => "It drinks the soul of every enemy slain. Those souls keep the queen young and beautiful forever."
"Qahramon medalyonni to'ldiradi — so'ng u qahramonni ham yutadi. Sening yigiting endi qora qasrda, la'nat ichida." => "The hero fills the medallion — then it swallows the hero too. Your beloved is in the dark castle now, under the curse."
"U urushni to'xtatmaydi — malika esa yangi qahramonlar chaqiraveradi. Seni ham shu nur olib keldi." => "It will not stop the war — and the queen keeps summoning new heroes. That same light brought you here too."
"Qanday tugataman?" => "How do I end it?"
"Malikani o'ldir. Medalyon sinadi, jonlar ozod bo'ladi, la'nat ko'tariladi. Ammo uning qasri sehr bilan yopiq." => "Kill the queen. The medallion will shatter, the souls will go free, the curse will lift. But her castle is sealed by magic."
"Avval bosib olingan yerlarni ozod qil: uchta qal'a — Yashil dala, Toshli adir, Qumli dasht. Ularsiz darvoza ochilmaydi." => "First free the conquered lands: three castles — the Green Field, the Stony Hills, the Sandy Steppe. Without them the gate will not open."
"Iltimos, meni bu qafasdan chiqaring! Kampir qozonidan qaytmasidan oldin..." => "Please, let me out of this cage! Before the crone returns from her cauldron..."
"Kalit o'sha o'likchida — u meni kampirga sotgan. Uni o'ldirsangiz, kalit sizniki." => "The key is on that necromancer — he sold me to the crone. Kill him and the key is yours."
"Jodugar" => "Witch"
"Asira" => "Captive"
"Kampirning xizmatkori" => "The Crone's Servant"

; ---- story/medallion.duke ----
"Jonlar" => "Souls"
"CURSED" => "CURSED"
"Qahramon la'natlandi" => "The hero is cursed"
"Medalyonni yechib bo'lmaydi: u menga bog'lanib qolgan" => "The medallion cannot be taken off: it has bound itself to me"
"Malikaning medalyoni" => "The Queen's Medallion"
"Tumor" => "Charm"
"Jon yutish" => "Soul Drain"
"Jon" => "Soul"
"Xush kelibsiz, qahramon. Saltanatimda qahramon qolmadi — siz oxirgisisiz." => "Welcome, hero. No heroes remain in my kingdom — you are the last."
"Bu medalyonni taqing. U siz o'ldirgan har bir dushmanning jonini yutib, kuchini sizga quyadi." => "Wear this medallion. It drinks the life of every enemy you slay and pours their strength into you."
"Uni faqat qahramon taqa oladi. Zalga boring, so'ng mehrobga." => "Only a hero can wear it. Go to the hall, then to the altar."
"Rahmat, malikam." => "Thank you, my queen."
"Medalyon to'ldi. Rahmat, qahramon — u yana mening qo'limda." => "The medallion is full. Thank you, hero — it is in my hands again."
"Endi siz menikisiz." => "Now you are mine."

; ---- story/story.duke ----
"Qo'mondon Laylo" => "Commander Laylo"
"Nihoyat keldingiz! Siz chaqirilgan qahramonsiz, to'g'rimi?" => "At last you have come! You are the summoned hero, aren't you?"
"Men... qayerdaman? Bir lahza oldin mashq qilayotgan edim." => "Where... am I? A moment ago I was training."
"Vaqt yo'q. Devor ortidagi zalda skeletlar to'planmoqda — beshtasini yo'q qiling." => "There is no time. Skeletons are gathering in the hall behind the wall — destroy five of them."
"Va agar uzoq zalda tumorimni topsangiz — u menga onamdan qolgan." => "And if you find my charm in the far hall — it was left to me by my mother."
"Beshtasi ham yo'q bo'ldi? Siz haqiqatan qahramonsiz." => "All five are gone? You truly are a hero."
"Mana, bu qo'lqopni oling. Endi zal oxiridagi qo'riqchini yengish qoldi." => "Here, take this gauntlet. Now only the guard at the end of the hall remains."
"Tumorim! Rahmat. Buni hech qachon unutmayman." => "My charm! Thank you. I will never forget this."
"Devordagi skeletlar" => "Skeletons Behind the Wall"
"Qo'mondon Laylo aytdi: devor ortidagi zalda skeletlar to'planmoqda. Beshtasini yo'q qiling va unga qayting." => "Commander Laylo said: skeletons are gathering in the hall behind the wall. Destroy five and return to her."
"Qo'mondonga qayting" => "Return to the commander"
"Yo'qolgan tumor" => "The Lost Charm"
"Qo'mondonga onasidan qolgan tumor uzoq zalda yo'qolgan. Uni topib, egasiga qaytaring." => "The commander's charm, left to her by her mother, is lost in the far hall. Find it and return it to its owner."
"Uzoq zalda tumorni toping" => "Find the charm in the far hall"
"Tumorni qo'mondonga bering" => "Give the charm to the commander"
"Ana u — burchakdagi sandiq! Tumorim o'sha yerda bo'lishi kerak." => "There it is — the chest in the corner! My charm must be there."
"Ehtiyot bo'ling! Ular orqamizdan kelishdi!" => "Careful! They have come up behind us!"
"Ana o'sha sandiq, uzoq zalning burchagida. Tumorim ichida." => "There is the chest, in the corner of the far hall. My charm is inside."
"Davom etish uchun bosing / Space" => "Click or press Space to continue"
"Skeletlarni qiring %d/%d" => "Slay the skeletons %d/%d"

