"Yo'lovchi" => "Traveller"
"Chayqovchi Sobir" => "Peddler Sobir"
"Minorabon" => "Tower Keeper"
"Assalomu alaykum, mehmon! Qishlog'imizga xush kelibsiz." => "Peace be with you, guest! Welcome to our village."
"Yer bu yil yaxshi hosil berdi. Faqat kechalari yo'llardan uzoqroq yuring." => "The land gave a good harvest this year. Just keep away from the roads at night."
"Yo'lingiz ochiq bo'lsin! Men qishloqdan qishloqqa yuraman." => "May your road be open! I walk from village to village."
"To'xtang, to'xtang! Yo'l uchun kerakli narsalar bor — arzon!" => "Stop, stop! I have everything you need for the road — cheap!"
"Minoradan minoraga yo'l bor. Qaysi biriga borasiz? Xaritani ochaman." => "There is a road from tower to tower. Which one will you take? I will open the map."
"Bog'iston" => "Bog'iston"
"Yo'lda..." => "On the road..."
"Minoradan minoraga" => "From tower to tower"

