; ---- units/knight.duke ----
"Garen" => "Garen"
"Qalqon va qilich" => "Shield and Sword"
"Qilich to'lqini" => "Sword Wave"
"Qilichini siltaydi va undan to'lqin otilib chiqadi. To'lqin yo'lidagi har bir dushmanni bir martadan kesib o'tadi — tanaga urilib to'xtamaydi, faqat devor yoki o'z masofasi tugaganda to'xtaydi." => "He swings his sword and a wave bursts from it. The wave cuts through every enemy in its path once — it is not stopped by bodies, only by a wall or the end of its range."
"Qalqon bilan surish" => "Shield Charge"
"Qalqonini oldinga tutib, ko'rsatilgan tomonga yugurib ketadi. Yo'lida uchragan har bir dushmanni ilib, o'zi bilan birga suradi, to'xtaganda esa ularni oldiga tashlab, gangitib qo'yadi." => "Holding his shield forward, he rushes in the chosen direction. He catches every enemy in his path and carries them along, then throws them down in front of him when he stops, leaving them stunned."
"Ajdar qoni" => "Dragon Blood"
"Tomirlarida ajdar qoni oqadi: har bir zarbadan kamroq zarar oladi va har soniyada o'zi tuzalib boradi. Har bir darajada ikkalasi ham kuchayadi. Bosilmaydi — doim ishlaydi." => "Dragon blood runs in his veins: he takes less damage from every blow and heals himself every second. Both grow stronger with each rank. Not cast — always active."
"Teskari qutb" => "Reverse Polarity"
"Atrofidagi barcha dushmanlarni bir nuqtaga — o'zining ro'parasiga — tortib keladi, ularga zarar yetkazadi va gangitib qo'yadi. To'plangan dushmanlarni bitta to'lqin bilan kesish mumkin." => "Pulls every enemy around him to one point — right in front of him — damaging and stunning them. The gathered enemies can be cut down with a single wave."

; ---- units/mage.duke ----
"Lira" => "Lira"
"Olov va muz" => "Fire and Ice"
"Olov o'qi" => "Fire Bolt"
"Yo'nalish bo'ylab olov o'qi otadi. Birinchi uchragan tanaga yoki devorga urilib to'xtaydi va o'sha joyda portlaydi." => "Fires a bolt of flame in the chosen direction. It stops at the first body or wall it hits and explodes there."
"Muz to'lqini" => "Ice Wave"
"Tanlangan joyda muz portlatadi: u yerdagilarga zarar beradi va ularni bir muddat sekinlashtiradi. Zarari emas — sekinlashuvi muhim." => "Detonates ice at the chosen spot: it damages everything there and slows it for a while. The slow matters more than the damage."
"Bir zumda boshqa joyda paydo bo'ladi. Oradagi narsa — devormi, dushmanmi — umuman ahamiyatsiz." => "Appears elsewhere in an instant. What lies between — wall or enemy — does not matter at all."
"Tanlangan joyga meteor chaqiradi. U bir zumda tushmaydi: yerda ogohlantiruvchi doira paydo bo'ladi, va undan chiqib ketishga ulgurgan omon qoladi." => "Calls a meteor down on the chosen spot. It does not land at once: a warning circle appears on the ground, and whoever manages to step out of it survives."
"Siljish" => "Blink"

