"Atrofidagi o'zinikilar har zarbasidan jon qaytarib oladi." => "Allies around him recover health with every blow they land."

; ---- units/rogue.duke ----
"Erika" => "Erika"
"O'q ustasi" => "Master of the Bow"
"Og'ir o'q" => "Heavy Arrow"
"Kamonni to'liq tortib bitta dushmanga og'ir o'q otadi. O'q xonani kesib o'tadi, shuning uchun nishon qochib ulgurishi mumkin." => "Draws the bow fully and looses a heavy arrow at a single enemy. The arrow cuts across the room, so the target may have time to run."
"O'q yomg'iri" => "Arrow Rain"
"Atrofdagi hamma dushmanga bir vaqtda zarar yetkazadi. Qurshab olinganda bosiladi." => "Damages every enemy around her at once. Used when surrounded."
"Ko'rsatilgan tomonga tez siljiydi. Hech kimga zarar bermaydi — bu jangdan chiqish yo'li, jangga kirish emas." => "Dashes swiftly in the chosen direction. Hurts no one — it is a way out of a fight, not into one."
"Nishonga ol" => "Take Aim"
"Bir muddat uning hamma zarbalari kuchliroq bo'ladi. O'zi hech kimga tegmaydi — bu boshqa hamma narsani qimmatroq qiladigan oyna." => "For a time all her blows hit harder. She hits no one herself — it is a window that makes everything else worth more."
"Chopish" => "Dash"

